"description":"Welcome to Colony Flow — a relaxing ant colony puzzle where every tiny worker has a mission: carry colorful cubes, follow the trail, and help you discover beautiful pixel art!\n\nDeep inside the colony, the ants are ready to work together. Simply tap a cube stack to send an ant marching. Each ant picks up colorful cubes and carries them to the matching color hole. Sort every color, clear the board, and discover vibrant pixel art along the way.\n\nLead the colony with smart moves.\nSend worker ants from each cube stack.\nMatch cubes by color.\nGuide cubes to the correct color holes.\nManage limited colony slots.\nClear the entire board.\nDiscover beautiful pixel art.\n\nBut the colony needs a great leader! Sorting space is limited, so one wrong move can block the trail. Plan ahead, free up space, and guide your ants in the perfect order to complete every puzzle.\n\nExplore hundreds of colorful colony missions featuring adorable pixel art themes, including animals, fruits, food, flowers, nature, holidays, toys, rockets, castles, and many more surprises.\n\nWith cute ants, smooth marching animations, calming music, and no time pressure, Colony Flow is the perfect game to enjoy during a relaxing break, a cozy evening, or anytime you want to play offline.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Charming ant colony gameplay\n* Tiny worker ants carrying colorful cubes\n* Relaxing color sorting puzzles\n* Unlock beautiful pixel art\n* Simple one-tap controls\n* Fun and challenging brain teasers\n* No timer, no pressure\n* Play offline anytime, anywhere\n* From easy levels to tricky colony missions\n\nCommand the colony, sort the cubes, clear the trail, and complete beautiful pixel art in Colony Flow!", "averageUserRating":4.68006000000000010885514711844734847545623779296875, "minimumOsVersion":"15.0", "trackCensoredName":"Colony Flow!", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/colony-flow/id6779167923?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4